# How story #12 reached dev (WP4.8 merge gate).
title: From pull request to dev
pr: Pull request | Story #12, opened by the build lane.
gate: Merge gate | Runs verify again on the head commit in CI.
floors: Floors | Coverage, SAST, and accessibility.
inspect: Inspect | The review lane judges each criterion against its evidence.
ledger: Ledger | Keeps the authoritative pack P1.
dev: dev | Squash-merged once the gate is green.
pr -> gate: head commit
gate -> floors: run again
gate -> inspect: diff and pack
floors -> ledger: results
inspect -> ledger: disposition
ledger -> dev: green gate
